      "message": "Entity \"User\" has no %%entity help:.",
      "line": 9,
      "hint": "Add `%%entity User help: …` — what this record is for in the business, when one is created, and what distinguishes it from the entities it sounds like. It becomes sys_table.description and opens the entity's section of the manual.",
      "autoFixable": false
    },
    {
